C.G.D.C.R. - 2017\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}WATER TANK IS PROVIDED AS PER THE PROVISION OF THE CLAUSE NO. 13.6 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}LETTER BOX FOR EACH UNIT SHALL BE PROVIDED AR GROUND FLOOR LEVEL FOR EACH UNIT.\P{\fSymbol|b0|
  3
i0|c2|p18;·	}WATER TANK FOR FIRE SAFETY REQUIREMENT PROVIDED AS PER FIRE PREVENTION AND FIRE SAFETY ACT-2016\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}ELECTRICAL INFRASTRUCTURE SHALL BE PROVIDED AS PER CLAUSE NO. 13.11 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}D
  3
RINKING WATER FACILITY FOR DISABLED PERSONS IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO.13.6.2 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}DRAINAGE FACILITY IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO.13.10 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}SIGNAGES OF THE PARKING
  3
 PLACE IS TO BE PROVIDED AS PER THE PROVISION OF THE CLAUSENO. 13.7 OF C.G.D.C.R. 207\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}ENTRANCE OF THE BUILDING IS PROVIDX ED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO.13.1.6 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}THE PAVING OF BUILDING UNI
  3
T/FINAL PLOT AS PER THE PROVISION OF THE CLAUSE NO. 13.1.3 OF C.G.D.C.R. 2017\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}THE STRUCTURE OF THE BUILDING IS DESIGNED AS PER THE NORMS SPECIFIED IN THE INDIAN STANDARD AND NACESSARY ACTION SHALL BE TAKEN FOR THE STRUCTRA
  3
L SAFETY DURING THE CONSTRUCTION.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}RAIN WATER STORAGE TANK AND RAIN WATER HARVESTING SYSTEM IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO.17.2  OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}COMMUNITY BIN PROVIDED AS PER THE PROVISION OF TH
  3
E CLAUSE NO.17.2.4 & 17.2.5 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}GREY WATER RECYCLING SYSTEM & DUAL PLUMBING SYSTEM IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO. 17.3 OF C.G.D.C.R. 2017\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}TREE PLANTATION IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLA
  3
USE NO.17.4  OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}SOLAR ASSISTED WATER HEATING SYSTEM IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CLAUSE NO.17.5 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}POLLUTION CONTROL SYSTEM IS PROVIDED AS PER THE CHAPTER NO. 18 OF CGDCR 2017.
  3
\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}FIRE SAFETY SYSTEM IS PROVIDED AS PER CHAPTER 14 OF C.G.D.C.R. - 2017\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}FIRE SAFETY PROVISION SHALL BE MADE AS PER FIRE PREVENTION AND LIFE SAFETY MEASURES REGULATION-2016 AND FIRE PREVENTION AND
  3
 LIFE SAFETY MEASURES REGULATION-2013\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}MAINTANANCE AND UPGRADATION OF BUILDING IS AS PER CHAPETER NO. 19 OF CGDCR 2017.\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}MARGINAL SPACE & BASEMENT SLAB SHALL HAVE LOAD BEARING CAPACITY OF 45 TONNE
  3
S PER SQURE METER SHALL BE PROVIDED AS PER CHAPTER NO.14 OF. C.G.D.C.R. 2017 AND FIRE PREVENTION AND FIRE SAFETY ACT-2016\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}ROOF TOP SOLAR ENERGY INSTALLATION & GENERATION SHALL BE PROVIDED AS PER CLAUSE NO.17.5.1 OF C.G.D.C
  3
.R.-2017\P{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·	}THE GLAZED SURFACE AREA OF THE EXTERNAL FACADE SHALL BE NON REFLACTIVE AND PROVIDED UP TO MAX OF 50% OF THE TOTAL SURFACE AREA OF EACH FACADE WITH THE PROVISION OF SAFETY RAILLING UP TO SILL LEVEL AS PER CLAUSE NO
